{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>From every guardian</b> — these are negative commandments, which a person is obligated to guard himself from. Another interpretation: more than from every guard, guard your heart from pondering evil." "<b>For from it are the issues of life</b> — and it is like a king in the body."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:02.168076702Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}